    "cor:prescribed": "Dk contains exact integer markers m>=2 occurring in SOME distinct exact-k expansion ofONE; different markers can use DIFFERENT expansions. v(k) leastmissing>=2. Eventual exp(exp(k/600))<=v(k)<=1+k^(2^(k-1));liminf loglogv/k>=log2/257,limsup<=log2. Everyfixedc<log2/257 gives eventuallowerbound; endpointc inequality/limit/sharpslope NOT asserted.",
